  Brothers\, “your favorite band’s favorite band\,” and celebrates th
 e music\, creative journey\, and Catskills roots ofIan Felice\,James Felic
 e\,Jesske Hume\,andWill Lawrence. Following the screening at Assembly King
 ston\, The Felice Brothers will take the stage for a special live performa
 nce\, bringing the film and their music together for a one-of-a-kind eveni
 ng.\n\n🎟️ Tickets Available\n\n🔗 https://woodstockfilmfestival.org
